    <string-array name="changelog_1_1_0">
        <item>New option to skip a reminder when you have just logged an intake, with a configurable courtesy window (off by default).</item>
        <item>The \"Next reminder\" indicator on the home screen now always matches the reminder that is really scheduled.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="changelog_1_0">
        <item>Home screen with progress ring, one-tap logging of your default amount and today\'s records list.</item>
        <item>History for the last 30 days with daily totals, average, best day and current streak.</item>
        <item>Exact reminders inside your time window, which stop once you reach the daily goal.</item>
        <item>Notification quick actions to log an intake or snooze the reminder for 15 minutes.</item>
        <item>Settings for daily goal, time window, reminders per day, intake sizes and language.</item>
        <item>Spanish and English, no account and no cloud: all your data stays on the device.</item>
    </string-array>

